      "writtenOn": "2021-11-15T18:19:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IllegalArgumentException is a RuntimeException.\n\nhttps://docs.oracle.com/javase/7/docs/api/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\n\nRuntimeException should almost never be thrown directly, Both are parcelable exceptions. I\u0027m going to try and make my code better without making the existing code worse. :-)",
      "parentUuid": "de0b9e74_d08fd45a",
