        "id": 1112039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-16T07:48:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "setOpportunistic is a field in subscription info. But this is not. This has a corresponding hal api.  Can you please add a comment on the difference in behavior for active subscription and inactive subscription here.",
      "parentUuid": "b933741c_ef4c4cfa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4544,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 4544,
        "endChar": 48
