      "writtenOn": "2021-11-15T18:19:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not directly. A change will trigger the onSubscriptionsChangedListener() and the phone object will update the settings for its active subscriptions (which can follow approximately the same logic as the sim-load case).",
